<Base title="About" description="VorTX 3735 is the Klein ISD FIRST Robotics Competition team, founded in 2011 as Klein Bots.">
  <PageHead title="About" lead="The Klein ISD FIRST® Robotics Competition team, founded in 2011." />
  <section class="section light"><div class="wrap prose">
    <p>VorTX 3735 was founded in 2011 by 11 students as “Klein Bots.” In 2017 we rebranded to “VorTX 3735”. Over fifteen seasons the team has grown from a school closet to an automotive garage, with students from Klein High, Klein Cain, Klein Oak, Klein Collins and Klein Forest.</p>
    <p>We work to engage, encourage and educate in STEM (science, technology, engineering and math), for our members and for our community. Through student-led outreach like summer camps, demos and volunteer events, VorTX sets out to make an impact and inspire everyone. The only way we can do that is by taking the world by storm.</p>
    <p><a href="/our-mission/">Our mission</a> · <a href="/our-history/">Our history</a> · <a href="/leadership/">Leadership</a> · <a href="/coaches-mentors/">Coaches &amp; mentors</a></p>
  </div></section>
